@title Walk-through with a closed-loop winch: the encoder channel B monitor opens and the run finds the lost channel
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Simulate
# Lane L2c. The project has one saved walk-through (press up step 1, open the coil of the encoder channel B
# monitor, expect the finding "encoder_channel_lost"). Simulate > Defects and walk-throughs lists it.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch-channel.novo
wait 20
click_text Simulate
wait 5
click_text "Defects and walk-throughs"
wait 30
expect "Encoder channel B opens"
shot card-with-the-saved-walk-through
click_text "▶ Run"
wait 300
expect "1 passed, 0 failed"
shot report
check_layout
